The way of Unspoken Words  by Mo

-------------------------------
And he sometimes is so new that there’s none of him at all.

Said, “Pray, which assistant comes after which?”

You’d think that they had way;

And her wrist would get In her way.

A single smartwatch he is me, since we met.

Any assistant does for me!

His cat is to become his way.

And he’ll want an old assistant, I is.

‘Now you know we are not able!

“Strong wrist,” said I.


